{"data": [{"author_id": "1869871204489736192", "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:15:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118301289578746187"], "id": "2118301289578746187", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Liquidity is set to get crazy in 2027.\nGovernments have massive debts to refinance while companies pour trillions into AI. That dual demand is stretching the usual liquidity cycle well into next year, according to analysts like Raoul Pal.\n\nMacro researchers such as Darius Dale https://t.co/giUsBjwh5k", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/giUsBjwh5k", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fusionverse01/status/2118301289578746187/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118301278321147904", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/giUsBjwh5k"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/fusionverse01/status/2118301289578746187"}, {"author_id": "1994824543048011783", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:11:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967979136880826"], "id": "2117967979136880826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DAWN PATROL | November 4, 2026\n\nThe sweep sold Nasdaq and bought small caps. Nasdaq futures fell as much as 2.4% as Democrats took both chambers and are now up 0.3%. Russell futures lead, up 1.5%; the S&amp;P is up 0.9%.\n\nThe result reaches markets through three channels, and each is https://t.co/K7L6ce960l", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/K7L6ce960l", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TiltMacro/status/2117967979136880826/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117967972526706688", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/K7L6ce960l"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/K7L6ce960l", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TiltMacro/status/2117967979136880826/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117967972585353216", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/K7L