.co/JoXqNJBLrV", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JoXqNJBLrV", "end": 127, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WhaleWireNews/status/2118276585635590608/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118276583316176896", "start": 104, "url": "https://t.co/JoXqNJBLrV"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/WhaleWireNews/status/2118276585635590608"}, {"author_id": "1924580792216518656", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:10:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118012965701976478"], "id": "2118012965701976478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1331, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sofr-iorb now at positive 7bps. Sofr is now only -3bps from the rate ceiling.\n\nWe could be 1-2 bad settlements away from breaching the ceiling.\n\nBank reserves went down $140B since Oct 14.\n\nThematic rotation tracker showing increased weekly rotations out of ai theme which is https://t.co/RRqeFIS8zz", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RRqeFIS8zz", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/gofallingknife/status/2118012965701976478/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118012962380070912", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/RRqeFIS8zz"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/gofallingknife/status/2118012965701976478"}, {"author_id": "1931414132164542464", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:19:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118317399627702355"], "id": "2118317399627702355", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Treasury has begun to inject liquidity into the financial system.\n\nThe Treasury General Account (TGA) balance has dropped about $114 Billion in last 10 days.\n\nWhen TGA falls, liquidity flows into commercial banks, which boosts bank reserves and overall market liquidity... 🔥", "url": "https://x.com/Gharenexx/status/2118317399627702355"}, {"author_id": "1526406624507723776", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:24:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117729652735344725"], "id": "2117729652735344725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 5922, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "🚨 NEW VIDEO 🚨\nThe Fed Will Have To Print Bigger This Time\n\nNik on the three money market charts he watches as a former repo trader: the SOFR spread at a yearly high, $7 trillion in T-bills needing funding, and bank reserves back near 2019 levels. https://t.co/ZuRuBriUzp", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZuRuBriUzp", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheBitcoinLayer/status/2117729652735344725/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117715937239707648", "start": 247, "url": "https://t.co/ZuRuBriUzp"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/TheBitcoinLayer/status/2117729652735344725"}, {"author_id": "2070363238932373504", "created_at": "2026-11-05T09:20:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118272127300501731"], "id": "2118272127300501731", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 3695, "like_count": 89, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "Treasury has begun to inject liquidity into the financial system.\n\nThe Treasury General Account (TGA) balance has dropped about $114 Billion in last 10 days.\n\nWhen TGA falls, liquidity flows into commercial banks, which boosts bank reserves and overall market liquidity. https://t.co/VzQn9GVpnP", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VzQn9GVpnP", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/macropaperr/status/2118272127300501731/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118272016575033344", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/VzQn9GVpnP"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/VzQn9GVpnP", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/macropaperr/status/2118272127300501731/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118272044857163776", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/VzQn9GVpnP"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/macropaperr/status/2118272127300501731"}, {"author_id": "1671952948308373504", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:03:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118328434514354465"], "id": "2118328434514354465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SOFR ABOVE THE FED'S IORB 9 DAYS IN A ROW\nSOFR, the benchmark rate for overnight loans backed by Treasuries, was 3.94% on November 4, 4 basis points above the 3.90% the Fed pays banks on reserves (IORB), according to the New York Fed. It has printed above IORB for 9 straight https://t.co/sq1gB2M5ZA", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sq1gB2M5ZA", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/arturillo955/status/2118328434514354465/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118328430584360960", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/sq1gB2M5ZA"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/arturillo955/status/2118328434514354465"}, {"author_id": "1192899214487019520", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:29:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118017771346997305", "2118017874069696839"], "id": "2118017874069696839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 183, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Election low on $ES / $NQ got bought, but liquidity still isn’t supportive.\n\nRRP is basically empty (427M). TGA is still elevated near $1T. When RRP is drained and TGA stays high, the Treasury is holding cash that would otherwise sit in bank reserves. That keeps conditions https://t.co/5zpkZr2LLv", "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 19, "start": 16, "tag": "ES"}, {"end": 25, "start": 22, "tag": "NQ"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5zpkZr2LLv", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/livefreeordie_t/status/2118017874069696839/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118017767781867520", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/5zpkZr2LLv"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/5zpkZr2LLv", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/livefreeordie_t/status/2118017874069696839/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118017767777742