, overnight Treasury repo has cost more than the Fed pays banks on reserves. 7 straight business days. Fed funds hasn't moved.\n\nNothing's broken, but the reverse repo cushion is ~$0.2B. Tomorrow's refunding decides what lands on it.\n\n#Treasury #Fed", "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 255, "start": 246, "tag": "Treasury"}, {"end": 260, "start": 256, "tag": "Fed"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/CensorNet/status/2117780275807789232"}, {"author_id": "1888516575478837248", "created_at": "2026-11-05T04:42:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118202292113649694"], "id": "2118202292113649694", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Two reasons to stay constructive on crypto into year-end\n\nFirst, liquidity: this week’s Treasury quarterly refunding is key. TGA is targeted at about $850bn by end-December, down from a late-October peak near $1.05T — a roughly $200bn draw that would lift bank reserves and ease", "url": "https://x.com/0xlunasterling/status/2118202292113649694"}, {"author_id": "510407143", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:29:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117866768265867307"], "id": "2117866768265867307", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 6408, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "TURKEY: Morning Report — Fund Crisis Drains Central Bank Reserves as Inflation Persists and Auto Sales Slump\n\nhttps://t.co/sKrucsbNRs", "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "November 4, 2026 | Markets and Macroeconomics Summary: Türkiye's economic slowdown is becoming more visible as the investment fund crisis co", "display_url": "patreon.com/PATUrkey879/po…", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://www.patreon.com/PATUrkey879/posts/turkey-morning-174341644?utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=postshare_creator&utm_content=join_link", "start": 110, "status": 200, "title": "TURKEY: Morning Re